OL,3,GNEWSASex offender who broke into girl's
OL,4,Abedroom jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who broke into a house and tried
OL,7,Fto grab a teenage girl from her bed has
OL,8,Fbeen sentenced to 18 years in prison.
OL,10,FChristopher Buxey, 43, from Gosport,
OL,11,Fbroke into the home of a family in a
OL,12,Fvillage near Chichester, West Sussex,
OL,13,Fin the early hours of 4 June.
OL,15,FThe teenager woke to find him standing
OL,16,Fover her wearing black clothing, a
OL,17,Fbalaclava and black latex gloves.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
