OL,3,GNEWSASex offender who broke into girl's
OL,4,Abedroom jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FBuxey was sentenced at Portsmouth Crown
OL,7,FCourt on Thursday for attempted false
OL,8,Fimprisonment, trespass with intent to
OL,9,Fcommit a sexual offence, and actual
OL,10,Fbodily harm in Sussex, as well as for a
OL,11,Fseparate case of child sex abuse in
OL,12,FHampshire.
